      "id": "Q6",
      "question": "What diagnostic investigations, if any, are indicated?",
      "my_answer": "None routinely; diagnosis is clinical. Consider a bacterial culture or swab if purulent drainage is present, or a KOH prep if fungal infection is suspected.",
