      "my_answer": "1) Gentle cleansing with mild soap; 2) Warm compresses 2–3 times daily; 3) Topical antiseptic (e.g., chlorhexidine) or over‑the‑counter benzoyl peroxide; 4) If bacterial infection suspected, short course of topical mupirocin; 5) Advise avoidance of close shaving, use single‑blade or electric trimmer, shave in direction of hair growth; 6) Apply non‑comedogenic moisturizer.",
